  "pass@k": "Whether a task succeeds at least once in k tries. Compare 'passes every time', which production needs.",
  "BLEU": "A score of word-sequence overlap with a reference answer, built for machine translation.",
  "ROUGE": "A score of how much of a reference text appears in the output, built for summarisation.",
