  "parent-child chunking|parent-child retrieval|small-to-big": "Search over small chunks for precision, then send their larger parent section to the LLM for full context.",
  "sentence-window retrieval": "Retrieve a single matching sentence, then add a few sentences before and after it as context.",
  "dense_vector": "The Elasticsearch field type that stores an embedding so it can be searched by similarity.",
  "kNN|k-nearest neighbour|k-nearest neighbor": "Finding the k stored vectors closest to the query vector.",
